 {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>"}]}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le09ob03re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Can I check your information?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "So I have a strategy of how to find a job I am passionate about, and I need to make a timeline to help me set my goals. I give myself four months. After that, I will need to tighten my belt.  It never is easy when the money runs out, is it?\n<br/>\nIn my first month, I will have found my big problem that I am going to solve. I will have identified a field that I am interested in and I will have explored work opportunities in that area. It sounds like a daunting task, doesn't it? However, in order to find my dream job, I need to establish where my interests lie.", "id": 1}, {"time": "39200", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "In month two, I will have made a list of companies that are trying to solve my problem and hopefully, share my interests. I will have researched each company and combed their web pages for job listings.\n<br/>\nThen, in my third month, I will have searched my circle of friends to see who is connected to my target companies. It does sound silly, doesn't it?  Nonetheless, establishing contacts already in the company is a great way to discover more about the organization.", "id": 2}, {"time": "72500", "image": "engenn9le09ob03re2img03.jpg", "text": "Finally in month four, I will have created a resume that is innovative and will capture people's attention. In the resume,  I will have highlighted how my passion can help the company meet its aspirations.\n<br/>\nAll of this won't help, will it? I have to stay positive.<br/>\nI can do this, can't I?", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting the Job You Want"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Following Your Passion"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Tag Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use tag questions to ask for clarification and confirmation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Question tags are short questions at the end of statements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "They are mainly used in speech when we want to:<ul><li><span class=\"strong\">clarify/confirm whether something is true or not true</span>, or</li><li><span class=\"strong\">to encourage a reply</span> from the person we are speaking to.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"1\">A <span class=\"strong\">positive</span> statement is followed by a <span class=\"strong\">negative</span> question tag.<br/> Use this when you think the other person will agree by saying \u2018yes' <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>You <span class=\"strong\">were</span> taken by surprise, <span class=\"strong\">weren't you?</span></li> <li>You <span class=\"strong\">are</span> Canadian, <span class=\"strong\">aren't</span> you?</li> <li>She <span class=\"strong\">has</span> a brother, <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span> she?</li> <li>He <span class=\"strong\">can</span> speak English, <span class=\"strong\">can't</span> he?</li></ul></span></li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"2\">A <span class=\"strong\">negative</span> statement is followed by a <span class=\"strong\">positive</span> question tag.<br/> Use this when you think the other person will agree by saying \u2018no'  <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>You <span class=\"strong\">weren't</span> taken by surprise, <span class=\"strong\">were you? </span></li> <li>You <span class=\"strong\">aren't</span> Canadian, <span class=\"strong\">are</span> you?</li> <li>She <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span> have a brother, <span class=\"strong\">does</span> she?</li> <li>He <span class=\"strong\">can't</span> speak English, <span class=\"strong\">can</span> he?</li></ul></span> </li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "If the main verb is <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> or a <span class=\"strong\">modal verb</span>, the tag will be the same. <br/>For <span class=\"strong\">all other main verbs</span>, use the tag <span class=\"italic\">do</span>/<span class=\"italic\">does </span>or <span class=\"italic\">did</span>/<span class=\"italic\">didn't</span>. <br/>Look at the examples in the chart."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tag\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tag\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He is/was\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"isn't/wasn't he?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" She has/had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"doesn't/didn't she?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"aren't you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"don't you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"can't he?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He likes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"doesn't he?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" We could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"couldn't we?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You like\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"don't you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"won't you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You liked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"didn't you?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It never is easy when the money runs out, is it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It sounds like a daunting task, doesn't it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It does sound silly, doesn't it?  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "All of this won't help, will it? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I can do this, can't I?  "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Tense vs. The Future Perfect Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future tense (<span class=\"italic\">will</span>) to talk about a one-time action or event in the future.<br/>You use the Future Perfect tense to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can sometimes think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.<br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for the structure of the Future Perfect tense:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"(<span class=\\\"italic\\\">not</span>) <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"found\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"created\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"not have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"searched\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " *Notice the position of <span class=\"italic\">not</span>. It comes between <span class=\"italic\">will </span>and <span class=\"italic\">have</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "In my first month, I will have found my big problem that I am going to solve. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have identified a field that I am interested in and I will have explored work opportunities in that area."}, {"type": "example", "content": "In month two, I will have made a list of companies that are trying to solve my problem and hopefully, share my interests. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have researched each company and combed their web pages for job listings."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then, in my third month, I will have searched my circle of friends to see who is connected to my target companies."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finally in month four, I will have created a resume that is innovative and will capture people's attention. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "In the resume, I will have highlighted how my passion can help the company meet its aspirations. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create and fill out a standard job application form online; name, age, address, phone number, previous job, and why you want to work for the company."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Swap the forms with another partner and role-play."}, {"type": "text", "content": "One partner will be the boss asking for clarification and opinion using Tag questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The other partner will be the applicant and correct his/her information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Afterwards, try and add more complex categories to the application form and role-play again."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use tag questions to clarify information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an application form inquiring about information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I perform a role-play using the target grammar, tag questions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tighten your belt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to manage to spend less money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will need to tighten my belt."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to look for work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to comb"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to arrange"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have researched each company and combed their web pages for job listings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "daunting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "cause fear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It sounds like a daunting task, doesn't it?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nonetheless"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "however"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Nonetheless, establishing contacts already in the company is a great way to discover more about the organization."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "innovative"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something new"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have created a resume that is innovative and will capture people's attention. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aspirations"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an ambition"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have highlighted how my passion can help the company meet its aspirations. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "circle of friends"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "close friends"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have searched my circle of friends to see who is connected to my target companies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le09ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le09ob03re1img01.jpg"}]}